[[North Carolina State Senate|State senator]] [[Erica D. Smith]], [[Mecklenburg County, North Carolina|Mecklenburg County]] commissioner Trevor Fuller, and former [[North Carolina State Senate|state senator]] [[Cal Cunningham]] ran for the Democratic nomination.

